# Input

```js
const fiveSpaceIndent = (data) => `
     ${
       data
       ?`<bar>${data.aBitLongerNameHelpingReproduceThisProblem}</bar>`
       :''
     }
`

const sixSpaceIndent = (data) => `
      ${
       data
       ?`<bar>${data.aBitLongerNameHelpingReproduceThisProblem}</bar>`
       :''
     }
`

```


# Options

```json
{
  "$schema": "../../../../../../../../packages/@biomejs/biome/configuration_schema.json",
  "formatter": {
    "indentStyle": "space",
    "indentWidth": 2
  }
}
```

# Formatted

```js
const fiveSpaceIndent = (data) => `
     ${
       data
         ? `<bar>${data.aBitLongerNameHelpingReproduceThisProblem}</bar>`
         : ""
     }
`;

const sixSpaceIndent = (data) => `
      ${
        data
          ? `<bar>${data.aBitLongerNameHelpingReproduceThisProblem}</bar>`
          : ""
      }
`;

```
